{"ticker":"T","updated":"2026-10-24T00:15:11Z","profile":{"longName":"AT&T Inc.","shortName":"AT&T Inc.","sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Telecom Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.att.com","fullTimeEmployees":133030,"marketCap":140994396160,"trailingPE":11.192513,"forwardPE":8.070394,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.0942352,"pegRatio":1.38,"targetMeanPrice":27.80435,"targetHighPrice":34.0,"targetLowPrice":20.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":23,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.053,"earningsGrowth":-0.904,"grossMargins":0.59742,"operatingMargins":0.24652,"profitMargins":0.101940006,"totalRevenue":128852000768,"beta":0.442,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":29.44,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":19.89,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":4.88},"summary":"AT&T Inc. provides telecommunications and technology services worldwide. It operates through two segments, Communications and Latin America. The Communications segment offers wireless voice and data communications services; and sells handsets, wireless data cards, wireless computing devices, carrying cases/protective covers, and wireless chargers through its own company-owned stores, agents, and third-party retail stores. It also provides AT&T Dedicated Internet, fiber ethernet and broadband, fixed wireless, and hosted and managed professional services; and copper-based voice and data, Virtual Private Networks (VPN), wholesale, outsourcing, and IP, as well as customer premises equipment for multinational corporations, small and mid-sized businesses, governmental, and wholesale customers. In addition, this segment offers broadband services, including fiber connections, legacy telephony voice communication services, and other VoIP services and equipment to residential customers. This segment markets its communications services and products under the AT&T, AT&T Business, Cricket, AT&T PREPAID, AT&T Fiber, and AT&T Internet Air brand names. Its Latin America segment provides postpaid and prepaid wireless services in Mexico under the AT&T and Unefon brand names, as well as sells smartphones through its stores, agents and third-party retail stores. The company was formerly known as S","summary_zh":"AT&T Inc. 在全球提供電信和技術服務。它透過兩個部門運作：通訊部門和拉丁美洲部門。通訊部門提供無線語音和數據通訊服務；並透過自營商店、代理商和第三方零售店銷售手機、無線數據卡、無線計算設備、手提箱/保護套和無線充電器。它還提供 AT&T 專用互聯網、光纖以太網和寬頻、固定無線以及託管和管理的專業服務；基於銅線的語音和數據、虛擬專用網路 (VPN)、批發、外包和 IP，以及跨國公司、中小型企業、政府和批發客戶的用戶端設備。此外，該部門也向住宅客戶提供寬頻服務，包括光纖連線、傳統電話語音通訊服務以及其他 VoIP 服務和設備。該部門以 AT&T、AT&T Business、Cricket、AT&T PREPAID、AT&T Fiber 和 AT&T Internet Air 品牌銷售其通訊服務和產品。其拉丁美洲部門以 AT&T 和 Unefon 品牌在墨西哥提供後付費和預付費無線服務，並透過其商店、代理商和第三方零售店銷售智慧型手機。該公司前身為S","sector_zh":"通訊服務","industry_zh":"電信服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":28.77,"h":28.98,"l":28.72,"c":28.74,"v":19405000},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":28.83,"h":28.96,"l":28.21,"c":28.56,"v":49407900},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":28.5,"h":29.08,"l":28.5,"c":29.06,"v":28026200},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":29.02,"h":29.02,"l":28.75,"c":28.94,"v":24658100},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":29.02,"h":29.33,"l":28.95,"c":29.29,"v":26562400},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":29.3,"h":29.4,"l":29.0,"c":29.08,"v":31571100},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":29.01,"h":29.08,"l":28.45,"c":29.04,"v":27245400},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":29.18,"h":29.7,"l":29.03,"c":29.58,"v":31845400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":29.58,"h":29.79,"l":29.42,"c":29.59,"v":25105900},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":28.5,"h":29.14,"l":28.28,"c":28.9,"v":40649300},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":28.9,"h":29.58,"l":28.83,"c":29.42,"v":35105500},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":29.25,"h":29.44,"l":28.9,"c":29.2,"v":25689400},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":29.29,"h":29.5,"l":29.12,"c":29.49,"v":23581000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":29.42,"h":29.6,"l":29.29,"c":29.57,"v":22794000},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":29.61,"h":29.79,"l":29.5,"c":29.62,"v":31486400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":29.62,"h":29.65,"l":29.21,"c":29.33,"v":28118200},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":29.33,"h":29.58,"l":29.25,"c":29.54,"v":25967200},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":29.35,"h":29.47,"l":29.14,"c":29.2,"v":30142900},{"t":"202